    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akumon Summoner is in active development.<br>If you're looking for a polished, bug-free, fully balanced game, this is <strong>not</strong> the right time.<br>Check reviews or join the Discord if you're unsure. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Akumon Summoner</i>, you play as <strong>Raven</strong>, a talented young summoner determined to prove herself by joining the prestigious <strong>Junior Tournament</strong>.<br>Follow her on a coming-of-age journey as she learns to master her powers and faces powerful opponents \u2014 all the way to adulthood and the rank of Elite Summoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture mysterious creatures called <strong>Akumons</strong>, each with unique abilities, and build a team of 4 fighters ready for any challenge. But be warned: victory lies in the synergy between summoner and Akumons.<br>Boost their stats or adapt your strategy to exploit enemy weaknesses. In this turn-based RPG, <strong>the summoner is just as important as the Akumon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401390/extras/0f69344076ffe2bc2b5fbab40ed82937.avif?t=1749575337\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before you buy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed by <strong>a solo developer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect <strong>bugs</strong>, unfinished elements, and ongoing tweaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some UI elements and animations are still placeholders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly updates</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Input must be <strong>disabled</strong> for some controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akumon Summoner is in active development.<br>If you're looking for a polished, bug-free, fully balanced game, this is <strong>not</strong> the right time.<br>Check reviews or join the Discord if you're unsure. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Akumon Summoner</i>, you play as <strong>Raven</strong>, a talented young summoner determined to prove herself by joining the prestigious <strong>Junior Tournament</strong>.<br>Follow her on a coming-of-age journey as she learns to master her powers and faces powerful opponents \u2014 all the way to adulthood and the rank of Elite Summoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture mysterious creatures called <strong>Akumons</strong>, each with unique abilities, and build a team of 4 fighters ready for any challenge. But be warned: victory lies in the synergy between summoner and Akumons.<br>Boost their stats or adapt your strategy to exploit enemy weaknesses. In this turn-based RPG, <strong>the summoner is just as important as the Akumon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401390/extras/0f69344076ffe2bc2b5fbab40ed82937.avif?t=1749575337\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before you buy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed by <strong>a solo developer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect <strong>bugs</strong>, unfinished elements, and ongoing tweaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some UI elements and animations are still placeholders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly updates</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Input must be <strong>disabled</strong> for some controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
